'''Pegasa''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals (Gacha Event)|Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals]] gacha event. She was added in [[Version 13.2 Update|Version 13.2]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 15.6 Update|Version 15.6]] increases health and Spirit Slow duration and grants [[Massive Damage]] and [[Immune to Freeze|Freeze Immunity]].

