==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]], Pegasa, [[Raclesa (Uber Rare Cat)|Raclesa]], [[Terun (Uber Rare Cat)|Terun]], [[Lilin (Uber Rare Cat)|Lilin]] and [[Jeanne (Legend Rare Cat)|Jeanne]]'s Evolved Forms were missing the ", type" part of their names that other Galaxy Gals had.
*Pegasa's name may be derived from ペガサス ''Pegasasu'' ([[wikipedia:Pegasus|Pegasus]], a winged horse from Greek mythology).
**It may also reference the  [[wikia:gundam:SCV-70 White Base|Pegasus White Base]] from the ''[[wikipedia:Mobile Suit Gundam|Mobile Suit Gundam]]'' series, especially since her [[True Form]] is titled "White Cage" in Japanese and adds some red accents to her mech.
*The "ν" in her Evolved Form's name is the Greek letter "nu".
*She was the first [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] to have the [[Conjure]] ability and the first [[:Category:Cats with Conjure ability|Conjurer]] to receive a True Form.

